This bundle embeds CSS from the IOP Design System, which is NOT covered by the
Mozilla Public License and is NOT redistributable outside Inditex:

  IOP Design System (Sewing)
  https://github.com/inditex/lib-sewingiopdsweb
  Copyright (C) Industria de Diseno Textil, S.A. (Inditex)
  Licensed under the INDITEX license — proprietary, internal use only

  @inditex/sewingiopdsweb-styles              design tokens, theming, breakpoints
  @inditex/sewingiopdsweb-react-components    per-component stylesheets

Both are resolved from the Inditex Artifactory registry at build time and their
CSS is compiled into `build/ui-bundle-<version>.zip`. Sites built with this
bundle are therefore for internal distribution only. Publishing such a site, or
the bundle itself, to a public location requires removing the design system CSS
first — see .opencode/skills/iop-ds-components/SKILL.md.

The typefaces referenced by those stylesheets (Helvetica Now Text SW10, Noto
Sans Mono) are loaded at runtime from https://amgassets.inditex.com and are not
embedded in this bundle.
